:: Day 6 EV

Wren took the warden's sword from the rack in the long boat. She held it in her right hand, point down, the way Captain Marsh held his, and stepped out onto the wet jetty boards.

[[She slips->The fall]]

:: The fall

Her feet went out from under her and she came down hard on her side, on top of the sword. When she could breathe again she was lying with the handle against her left ear and the blade flat under her ribs, and Pip was laughing at her from the bank.
